{
    "title": "TORN",
    "description": "TORN - Worlds largest text-based RPG.\r\n\r\nYou are now entering Torn City; a dark and dirty metropolis inhabited by two million real people involved in virtual crime, conquest, commerce and more. In this open-world, text-based role-playing crime game you can be whoever you want, be it Bully, Businessman or Barbarian, so long as you\u2019ve got the brains and bullets to back it up.\r\n\r\nTorn City is so gritty and real that British Prime Minister Theresa May's staff used this game to learn about real criminal behaviour. Don't believe us? Google it. \r\n\r\n\r\n\u2605 Become a master criminal by doing drive-by hits, kidnapping the Mayor and bombing government buildings\r\n\r\n\u2605 Tool up for the streets with hundreds of unique weapons and armour items\r\n\r\n\u2605 Bulk up at the gym and train yourself into an elite urban warrior\r\n\r\n\u2605 Mug your opponents to relieve them of their hard earned cash, or just leave them in the streets\r\n\r\n\u2605 Go legit and land yourself a high-flying job at one of thousands of player-owned companies\r\n\r\n\u2605 Prove yourself worthy and earn an invite to join one of thousands of established factions\r\n\r\n\u2605 Work with faction-mates to wage wars, commit large scale crimes and conquer territory\r\n\r\n\u2605 Experiment with dangerous drugs to boost your battle stats and gain a crucial edge\r\n\r\n\u2605 Pay others to do your dirty work by bountying your bullies and sending them to the hospital\r\n\r\n\u2605 Establish yourself as a financial kingpin by making shrewd investments and swindling fellow players\r\n\r\n\u2605 Bust a cap and break bones in our tactical turn-based attacking system\r\n\r\n\u2605 Purchase essential and exotic items at the city's player-run bazaars, or start your own and rip people off\r\n\r\n\u2605 Bankrupt rival players at the casino through games of poker and blackjack\r\n\r\n\u2605 Interact with the most unsettlingly realistic NPC's ever seen in a RPG, if you dare\r\n\r\n\u2605 Earn money and respect by doing dodgy deeds for the city's shadiest characters\r\n\r\n\u2605 Marry another player and share your supplies, stacks and secrets\r\n\r\n\u2605 Steal or buy cars to modify and enter into illegal street races\r\n\r\n\u2605 Buy an apartment, pimp it out and work up to your very own private island\r\n\r\n\u2605 Bust out inmates from the city jail and beat them until they're grateful\r\n\r\n\u2605 Scour the in-game newspaper for hints, tips and all the latest Torn City gossip\r\n\r\n\u2605 Immerse yourself in Torn's energetic forums and chat rooms for lively debate and constant competitions\r\n\r\n\u2605 Progress your character and play the game your way, then make your mark in our illustrious Hall of Fame\r\n\r\nTORN is a massively multiplayer text RPG (Role Playing Game). Play now for free.",
    "descriptionHTML": "TORN - Worlds largest text-based RPG.<br><br>You are now entering Torn City; a dark and dirty metropolis inhabited by two million real people involved in virtual crime, conquest, commerce and more. In this open-world, text-based role-playing crime game you can be whoever you want, be it Bully, Businessman or Barbarian, so long as you\u2019ve got the brains and bullets to back it up.<br><br>Torn City is so gritty and real that British Prime Minister Theresa May&#39;s staff used this game to learn about real criminal behaviour. Don&#39;t believe us? Google it. <br><br><br>\u2605 Become a master criminal by doing drive-by hits, kidnapping the Mayor and bombing government buildings<br><br>\u2605 Tool up for the streets with hundreds of unique weapons and armour items<br><br>\u2605 Bulk up at the gym and train yourself into an elite urban warrior<br><br>\u2605 Mug your opponents to relieve them of their hard earned cash, or just leave them in the streets<br><br>\u2605 Go legit and land yourself a high-flying job at one of thousands of player-owned companies<br><br>\u2605 Prove yourself worthy and earn an invite to join one of thousands of established factions<br><br>\u2605 Work with faction-mates to wage wars, commit large scale crimes and conquer territory<br><br>\u2605 Experiment with dangerous drugs to boost your battle stats and gain a crucial edge<br><br>\u2605 Pay others to do your dirty work by bountying your bullies and sending them to the hospital<br><br>\u2605 Establish yourself as a financial kingpin by making shrewd investments and swindling fellow players<br><br>\u2605 Bust a cap and break bones in our tactical turn-based attacking system<br><br>\u2605 Purchase essential and exotic items at the city&#39;s player-run bazaars, or start your own and rip people off<br><br>\u2605 Bankrupt rival players at the casino through games of poker and blackjack<br><br>\u2605 Interact with the most unsettlingly realistic NPC&#39;s ever seen in a RPG, if you dare<br><br>\u2605 Earn money and respect by doing dodgy deeds for the city&#39;s shadiest characters<br><br>\u2605 Marry another player and share your supplies, stacks and secrets<br><br>\u2605 Steal or buy cars to modify and enter into illegal street races<br><br>\u2605 Buy an apartment, pimp it out and work up to your very own private island<br><br>\u2605 Bust out inmates from the city jail and beat them until they&#39;re grateful<br><br>\u2605 Scour the in-game newspaper for hints, tips and all the latest Torn City gossip<br><br>\u2605 Immerse yourself in Torn&#39;s energetic forums and chat rooms for lively debate and constant competitions<br><br>\u2605 Progress your character and play the game your way, then make your mark in our illustrious Hall of Fame<br><br>TORN is a massively multiplayer text RPG (Role Playing Game). Play now for free.",
